WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.230
3 red cars and 2 blue cars.

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:04.960
How many cars?

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:07.050
Push the groups together.

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:09.840
Count them all: 5.

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:11.360
That is adding.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:14.016
3 + 2 is 5.
